ithub.com/webpack/webpack/issues/2990#issuecomment-247202961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/2990","id":247202961,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI0NzIwMjk2MQ==","user":{"login":"thomb","id":432878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjg3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb","html_url":"https://github.com/thomb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-09-15T00:58:19Z","updated_at":"2016-09-15T16:37:49Z","body":"Here goes. Its somewhat related to circular imports and the `require.ensure()` or at least that is my impression at this point\n\nI'm willing to call the root issue of the circular imports a problem with this implementation, but I still would expect an error or a warning to be thrown.\n\n[previous test case removed, see comment below for actual test case]\n\n```\nnpm install\nnpm run build:web // Success\nnpm run build:electron // Hangs forever\n```\n\nIn addition, I believe the infinite loop is actually in `lib/optimize/EnsureChunkConditionsPlugin.js` which appears to never have the `chunkCondition` satisfied. At the very least if the check of\n`this.applyPluginsBailResult(\"optimize-modules-basic\", this.modules)` is removed from the while loop on `lib/Compilation.js:546` the build does not go into an infinite loop\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/247202961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"thomb","id":432878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjg3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb","html_url":"https://github.com/thomb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/247205449","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/2990#issuecomment-247205449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/2990","id":247205449,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI0NzIwNTQ0OQ==","user":{"login":"thomb","id":432878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjg3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb","html_url":"https://github.com/thomb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","