ttic/delphin/pull/670.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Automattic/delphin/pull/670.patch","merged_at":"2016-09-29T13:33:27Z"},"body":"Addresses part of #649.\n\nThis PR:\n- Adds a pattern for splitting different sections of Delphin into different chunks.\n- Adds `PulsingDot` and displays it while a section is loading.\n- Adds a `vendor` chunk containing some of our third-party libraries.\n- Adds a `setUp`, `myDomains`, `hosts`, and `checkout` chunk. The `checkout` chunk is pre-loaded as soon as the page boots.\n\n**Note:** The first four commits are from #665 and will be removed when it is merged.\n\n**Testing**\n- Assert that code-splitting and pre-loading is working by:\n  - Visiting `/hosts`.\n  - Clicking `My Domains` in the footer when logged in and asserting that page loads.\n  - Visiting `/set-up-domain/foo.blog` while logged in and asserting that the page loads.\n  - Purchasing an application. \n- Assert that the pulsing dot is displayed when a section is loading by:\n  - Visiting `/` while logged in.\n  - Opening developer tools and enabling throttling (under the Network pane in Chrome - `Regular 2G` is slow enough).\n  - Click `My Domains`.\n  - Assert that a pulsing dot is displayed under the get.blog logo until the page loads.\n- [ ] Code\n- [x] Product\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Automattic/delphin/issues/670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Automattic/delphin/issues/670/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]